20260417/1121776635864420352382416.jpeg/y6RkPF1IyYK9jA4yeXpz4uXiSDl6boTITvYM9k72DPY\"/><figcaption>五大AI難取代高薪職業出爐，未來十年仍會成長（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>存到3000萬就能退休？過來人曝真實生活：錢花不完還增加</p><p>高薪就不撿便宜？月薪30萬照搶i珍食 網曝真正原因：無關薪水</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T04:22:40.366346+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1804,"images":29,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:00:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T04:57:50.961906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:17:56.564004+00:00","content_hash":"e39a451a82d9589eb18b15e143f5578477cbf019153b19394345ea0a56476ca7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}